    "Eight complete native translation units compiled with seventeen pinned patches and verified modified headers; no full kernel link or device execution.",
    "Emitted disable_subsys retains indirect state and disable callbacks with the stack context, then records the callback result before the native unlock/return. CONN_sys_disable_op contains the inlined CONN shutdown, protection call and summary, five control helper calls and short-circuited primary/secondary condition calls.",
